# Read by BuildKit for `docker build -f deployment/Dockerfile .` (it looks for <Dockerfile>.dockerignore
# next to the Dockerfile). The build context is the repository root; this keeps it to what the image
# needs: client/ (without its tools' folders) and server/acme_dialpad_rightbar plus
# server/requirements.txt.
.git
.gitignore
.codegraph
.idea
.vscode
.claude
docs
**/node_modules
**/.pnpm-store
**/.venv
**/dist
**/test-results
**/playwright-report
**/__pycache__
**/.pytest_cache
**/.ruff_cache
**/.tox
client/e2e
server/tests
contract
deployment
